// BT-4099: a plain `Value` sub-subclass of `DirectCtorPoint` — no custom
// constructors anywhere in its chain, so its `new` / `new:` stay direct
// (static and dynamic forms), with inherited fields defaulted.

DirectCtorPoint subclass: DirectCtorChild
  field: z = 0
